{"id":"orden","lemma":"orden","pos":"noun","rank":418,"glosses":["order (command)","order (request for some product or service or that which is requested)","order (law)"],"ipa":"/ˈoɾden/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"órdenes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/63/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-orden.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Usted dio la orden?","en":"Did you give the order?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458935","words":[{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Yo tengo órdenes.","en":"I have orders.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440304","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null]},{"text":"¿Ya puedo tomar su orden?","en":"Can I take your order now?","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to take"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"¿Quién dio la orden de hacerlo?","en":"Who gave the order to do it?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/765590","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"}]},{"text":"Esas son nuestras órdenes.","en":"Those are our orders.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800867","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},null]}]}